    <briefdescription>
<para>A base type of mapped iterator, that is useful for building derived iterators that do not need/want to store the map function (as in <ref refid="classllvm_1_1mapped__iterator" kindref="compound">mapped_iterator</ref>). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These iterators must simply provide a <computeroutput>mapElement</computeroutput> method that defines how to map a value of the iterator to the provided reference type. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
